{
 "_doc": "Content overlay for the fake Jira (ADR 0015). Keyed by issue key; merged over the generated content of the fixture issues. fieldDefs are appended to the GET /rest/api/3/field answer (Jira wire shape). issues.<key>.fields are Jira wire values served verbatim in the *all projection and GET /issue/{id}; dateFields/dateTimeFields map a field id to a day offset from today (date 'YYYY-MM-DD', datetime 09:30 local). attachments[].file names a file in testdata/media (size and bytes come from disk) and mediaFileId is the uuid served at /media/file/<uuid>/binary after the 303 from /attachment/content/<id>; day is the created day. comments[i] adds body, visibility and an optional editedDay (updated = that day 11:00) to the i-th comment (oldest first) the fixture already gives the issue; comment count and dates do not change. links[].direction is relative to this issue (inward: the other issue is inwardIssue). subtasks are keys of existing issues.",
